>FEATURES</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in intense naval battles with a fleet of 12 different ships, and make use of 3 types of unique ammunition.<br></li><li>Master the enhanced trading mechanics, manage your fleet and cities wisely, and defend your trading positions to establish your dominance.<br></li><li>Upgrade your ships and strengthen your crew by earning resources from quests, defeating enemies, and exploring new territories.<br></li><li>3 types of soldiers: Tank, Gunner and Agile are now the mainstay of your crew's fighting force.<br></li><li>Dive into the expanded Campaign Mode with five engaging storylines.<br></li><li>The game also introduces a revamped &quot;Boarding&quot; mode, featuring different soldier classes and a Captain who can take part in battles.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397510/extras/b13f62259c2e37af82250e5b6373dd1e.poster.avif?t=1741250130\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397510/extras/b13f62259c2e37af82250e5b6373dd1e.webm?t=1741250130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397510/extras/b13f62259c2e37af82250e5b6373dd1e.mp4?t=1741250130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
